@startjourney
title Create a data product
persona Data product team · one team, three resources, mostly in parallel

start Team decides to create a data product

sub Data contract : Contract editor
  - Create candidate data contract : EXP
  - Register candidate data contract to the catalog : EXP
  join Product approval
  - Promote data contract : DEV
  - Add data quality rules : DEV
  - Pass contract tests : DEV
  join Product review
  - Promote data contract : ACC
  - Pass end-to-end integration tests : ACC
  - Pass end-to-end UAT tests : ACC
  join Final approval
  - Promote data contract : PRD

sub Data pipeline : Notebook, then PySpark
  - Create data pipeline in a notebook : EXP
  - Deploy and run the pipeline on the compute cluster : EXP
  - Pass functional tests : EXP
    note Generated table complies with the data contract
  join Product approval
  - Promote data pipeline : DEV
  - Reimplement the business logic from notebook to PySpark : DEV
  - Implement unit tests : DEV
  join Product review
  - Promote data pipeline : ACC
  - Pass end-to-end integration tests : ACC
  - Pass end-to-end UAT tests : ACC
  join Final approval
  - Promote data pipeline : PRD

sub Compute cluster : Cluster console
  - Create a compute cluster visually : EXP
  join Product approval
  - Migrate the compute cluster : DEV
  - Optimize and reconfigure for cost and performance : DEV
  join Product review
  - Migrate the compute cluster : ACC
  - Optimize and reconfigure for cost and performance : ACC
  join Final approval
  - Migrate the compute cluster : PRD

end Data product is live in PRD
@endjourney
